  "slug": "angies-dads-best-cabbage-coleslaw",
  "name": "Angie's Dad's Best Cabbage Coleslaw",
  "recipe_type": "salad",
  "brief_description": "An absolutely delicious coleslaw, more tart and tangy than the creamy kind. It keeps well and can be made ahead of time.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "In a large bowl, combine cabbage, onion, carrots, and celery. Sprinkle with 1 cup sugar, and mix well. In a small saucepan, combine vinegar, oil, salt, dry mustard, and pepper. Bring to a boil. Pour hot dressing over cabbage mixture, and mix well."
    }
  ],
